WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:03.130
Unit twenty. Heat Illness Prevention!

2
00:00:04.070 --> 00:00:07.572
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.622 --> 00:00:10.788
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:10.838 --> 00:00:14.627
Today we learn about Heat Illness Prevention. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.642 --> 00:00:18.509
Heat. Say it with me. Heat!

6
00:00:22.043 --> 00:00:25.376
Hydration. Say it with me. Hydration!

7
00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:32.928
Electrolytes. Say it with me. Electrolytes!

8
00:00:36.391 --> 00:00:39.441
Shade. Say it with me. Shade!

9
00:00:42.963 --> 00:00:46.646
Rest breaks. Say it with me. Rest breaks!

10
00:00:50.136 --> 00:00:53.703
Heatstroke. Say it with me. Heatstroke!

11
00:00:57.173 --> 00:01:00.607
Symptoms. Say it with me. Symptoms!

12
00:01:04.190 --> 00:01:07.823
Emergency. Say it with me. Emergency!

13
00:01:11.342 --> 00:01:21.191
In extreme heat, hydration and shade are essential. Take rest breaks during sport, and replace electrolytes after heavy sweating. Know heatstroke symptoms — it is an emergency.

14
00:01:21.241 --> 00:01:24.054
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:25.396 --> 00:01:30.436
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:30.486 --> 00:01:31.670
Electrolytes!

17
00:01:32.788 --> 00:01:38.114
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:38.164 --> 00:01:39.314
Symptoms!

19
00:01:40.190 --> 00:01:44.437
Did you know? Confusion and hot, dry skin can be signs of heatstroke!

20
00:01:44.487 --> 00:01:46.516
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:47.695 --> 00:01:55.251
Think and answer. How can sports teams prevent heat illness?

22
00:01:55.301 --> 00:01:56.451
Great answer!

23
00:01:57.572 --> 00:02:02.003
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:02.053 --> 00:02:04.587
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

